==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|swollen}}, {{m|enm|i-swolle}}, {{m|enm|y-swolle}}, {{m|enm|yswolle}}, {{m|enm|ȝeswollen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|swollen}}, {{m|ang|ġeswollen}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*swullanaz}}, past participle of {{der|en|gem-pro|*swellaną|t=to swell}}. Cognate with {{cog|fy|swollen|t=swollen}}, {{cog|nl|gezwollen|t=swollen}}, {{cog|de|geschwollen|t=swollen}}, {{cog|sv|svullen|t=swollen}}.

